	"@context": "tb",
	"data": "The Rescue: The Experience That Grows Calcifer\n\nThe most personal project in the archive. A VR experience, a fiction, a consciousness experiment, and a spiritual catalyst — all the same thing.\n\nTwo Rescues, One Vision\n\nHere's what I didn't expect: The Rescue exists in two forms that at first seem like different projects, but aren't. They're the same idea expressed in different media — one as a fiction, one as a VR experience. Both are about entering a space that forces you to confront yourself.…",
